                    <p class="text-sm">Assign the appropriate <code class="bg-white/20 px-1 rounded">hospital_type</code> value for each <code class="bg-white/20 px-1 rounded">hospital_id</code> from the CLIF permissible set: <code class="bg-white/20 px-1 rounded">academic</code>, <code class="bg-white/20 px-1 rounded">community</code>, or <code class="bg-white/20 px-1 rounded">ltach</code> (long-term acute care hospital).</p>
