                    <h5 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Step 1: Pull Every Procedure Code</h5>
                    <p class="text-sm mb-3">Pull every completed procedure code from <strong>both</strong> professional billing and hospital billing sources. Unlike earlier versions, 3.0 does not restrict the table to a code list: ETL every CPT code and every ICD-10-PCS code.</p>
                    <div class="bg-white/10 p-3 rounded-lg text-sm">
                      <p class="text-xs mb-1">The mCIDE folder still carries a short reference list of procedure codes. In 3.0 it is <strong>not</strong> an inclusion filter.</p>
                      <a href="https://github.com/Common-Longitudinal-ICU-data-Format/CLIF/blob/3.0/mCIDE/patient_procedures/clif_patient_procedure_codes.csv" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-300 hover:underline text-xs">→ clif_patient_procedure_codes.csv</a>
                    </div>
