                        <span class="text-green-300 mr-2">✓</span>
                        Verify position_category contains only "prone" and "not_prone" (no nulls where position_name is populated)
                      </li>
                      <li class="flex items-start">
                        <span class="text-green-300 mr-2">✓</span>
                        Spot-check the distinct position_name values mapped to prone
                      </li>
                    </ul>
